      "description": "unpoller_device_upgradable == 1 -- backs the UnifiDeviceUpgradeAvailable alert. Grafana's own 'No data' panel state IS the correct empty state here (no rows = no pending updates) -- fieldConfig.noValue was tried first but only formats a null value within an existing row, it does not fire for a zero-row/zero-frame result, so it's correctly left off rather than shipping a no-op setting.",
